<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>LangSpan third-party licences</title>
<style>
  body { font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #1b1f24; background: #fff; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f5f6f8; padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; }
  li { margin: 0.1rem 0; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { color: #e6e8eb; background: #111317; } pre { background: #1c1f25; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>The <code>langspan</code> binary includes the following Rust crates, and the C code some of them build (SQLite through <code>libsqlite3-sys</code>; Tree-sitter and its grammars). Each is used under the licence shown. SQLite itself is in the public domain. LangSpan's own licence is in LICENSE, and the notices for this repository are in NOTICE.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>Licences</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
  <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
